{"mangaRefs":["file-1067-1069"],"locationRefs":[],"summary":{"en":"Conan, Ran, and Kazuha, who came to Tokyo, visited the Haido Shrine, which was best known for matchmaking. Owing to the encounter of the \"115 fate\" day, the shrine was rather crowded. Ran previously did not know about this popular attraction and inquired of Kazuha how she became aware of it. Kazuha explained it was because of Heiji, as she haphazardly saw him looking up information with regards to this shrine. From these recent words and deeds, Conan was convinced that Heiji was also there, and he soon found a suspicious man wearing a fox mask. On the other hand, Kazuha noticed a person among the crowd who did not seem to have the intent of matchmaking.","zhHans":"","zhHant":"","sourcePage":"The_Inauspicious_Matchmaking","sourceQuote":true},"characters":["character-rei-furuya","character-shuichi-akai","character-heiji-hattori","character-ran-mouri","character-kogoro-mouri","character-conan-edogawa","character-shinichi-kudo","character-andre-camel","character-azusa-enomoto","character-yusaku-kudo","character-wataru-takagi","character-jodie-starling","character-kazuha-toyama","character-rum","character-juzo-megure","character-kaitou-kid","character-muga-iori","character-yukiko-kudo","character-miwako-sato","character-momiji-ooka","character-james-black"],"organizations":[],"locations":[],"gadgets":[],"caseTypes":[],"sources":["src-abiting-conan-database","src-detective-conan-world-anime"],"detailStatus":"reviewed","coverage":{"directory":true,"basicFacts":true,"structure":true,"deepSpoilers":true},"raw":{"manga":"Vol. 100","specialLabel":null,"rawIndex":1084,"dcwMangaSource":"V100 - F9~11(1067-1069)","dcwMangaKind":"manga","dcwAirDate":"June 3, 2023"},"season":28,"solvedByRaw":"Conan Edogawa","solvedBy":"character-conan-edogawa","castNames":["Conan Edogawa","Ran Mouri","Kogoro Mouri","Heiji Hattori","Kazuha Toyama","Wataru Takagi","Miwako Sato","Shinichi Kudo","Juzo Megure","Yusaku Kudo","Yukiko Kudo